   "text": "University of Hertfordshire International College - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Hertfordshire International College - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nHertfordshire University is located just North of London University and ranks 601–800 among world universities in Times Higher Education World University Rankings in 2019. In subject specific rankings, it has an overall world ranking between 301-400 in Arts and Humanities.\nThe International College provides educational pathways and is located on the vibrant and modern University of Hertfordshire campus which is located in the center of Hatfield.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:24\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:04\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £14,787.00\nMin: £8,642.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n4%\n900 of 24,600 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1992\nCampus(es)\nHatfield\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bxBrjchMERI\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
